-- akn:att_20__hc_1/p1 akn:att_20__hc_1/p2 akn:att_20__hc_1/p3 akn:att_20__hc_1/p4 akn:att_20__hc_1/p5 akn:att_20__hc_1/p6 akn:att_20__hc_1/p7 akn:att_20__hc_1/p8 akn:att_20__hc_1/p9 akn:att_20__hc_1/p10 The transcriber's note naming the letter, and the letter's letterhead, date, references and address; no rule.

-- The letter of the Treasury's deputy budget commissioner and the
-- Ministry's Director-General: the Ministers of Education and of Finance
-- intend to bring the Government a proposal to stop, for the upper
-- divisions, carrying on with Government decisions 3020 (27.1.08) and
-- 4016 (24.8.08) on fewer pupils in a class, and 4018 (24.8.08) and 4275
-- (27.11.08) on a multi-year plan of more teaching hours. An intention,
-- not a duty: the Government's decisions are outside the corpus. The
-- organisation's answer is the seventh letter (oz-founding-letter-7).
@ref akn:att_20__hc_1/p11 akn:att_20__hc_1/p12
`the Government decisions the ministers intend to propose stopping for the upper divisions` MEANS
    LIST 3020, 4016, 4018, 4275

`the ministers are bound to bring the proposal` MEANS FALSE

`why the Government's decisions are not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "החלטות הממשלה מס' 3020 (27.1.08), 4016 (24.8.08), 4018 (24.8.08) ו-4275 (27.11.08)"

